Module
  name: game_killdissolve
  description: Dissolve kill effects - the dying monster's own sprite blows away as sand, comes apart in pixels, crumbles to ash, burns from the edges, collapses into the void, shatters and melts or rises as gold dust (outfit shaders chaos_outfit_kd_*, base patch 0201; server cosmetics.lua sends it on extended opcode 225, game_cosmetics hands it over); at most 6 at once, then the plain effect
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: true
  scripts: [ killdissolve_core, killdissolve ]
  dependencies:
    - game_interface
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1005
  @onLoad: init()
  @onUnload: terminate()
